@startuml
title Jewellery Shop Management System - Activity Diagram
start
:Admin logs in;
if (Existing customer?) then (yes)
  :Update customer details;
else (no)
  :Add new customer details;
endif
:Select jewellery items;
:Enter quantity;
if (Stock available?) then (yes)
  :Calculate total amount;
  :Generate bill;
  :Update customer purchase record;
  :Update stock;
  :Print bill;
else (no)
  :Display out of stock message;
  stop
endif
stop
@enduml
